<title>USA: Suburban Propane names Simonowicz CFO.</title>
<headline>Suburban Propane names Simonowicz CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WHIPPANY, N.J. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suburban Propane Partners LP on Monday said Anthony Simonowicz was named chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said Charles T. Hoepper has resigned as senior vice president and chief financial officer to pursue another business opportunity.</p>
<p>Anthony M. Simonowicz, previously vice president, corporate development for Suburban has been promoted to assume the additional responsibility of CFO.</p>
